GET http://localhost:5000/api/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhNTllZDU2OTg2NTRiODllZTk4ZjkxMiIsImlhdCI6MTc4NDI4MDE0OSwiZXhwIjoxNzg0ODg0OTQ5fQ.bfBFd0m4h_9eGwvc2ViSsQqNujyTvRzItYEHMpFZY9E
### Create a payment for the booking
POST http://localhost:5000/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "bookingId": "6a59f37ecae172ade0b5741d",
  "method": "esewa"
}
### Get my bookings (check status updated to confirmed)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
